# What NOT to ship in the .vsix.
#
# `src/extension.ts` is bundled by esbuild into out/extension.js, so every other emitted
# module is already inside that bundle: shipping out/*.js as well shipped the runtime code
# twice. The test suite and dev scripts have no business on a user's disk at all, and the
# previous four-line version excluded none of them.
src/
node_modules/
tsconfig.json
**/*.map

# Everything under out/ except the bundle.
out/**
!out/extension.js

# Development-only.
scripts/
.vscode/
.vscode-test/
.gitignore
package-lock.json
